OINTMENT and YOU WILL BE TURNED AWAY.\nCOMBINED SHIPPING:\nPlease contact us with any Combination requests BEFORE Payment. When practical in size and do not include breakables, may be requested for auctions that close\nwithin the same week.\nMaximum combined weight is 20 lbs. In some cases, combined shipments are more expensive due to increased box size.\nPrior to checking out, contact us with Buyer ID and won Item ID #s.\nWE ARE UNABLE TO COMBINE ORDERS OR REMOVE SALES TAX AFTER PAYMENT.\nWe reserve the right to deny combination of items to ensure safe shipping of items. Handling charges will not be reduced. .\nItems can only be combined prior to payment being received. Paid for items will be shipped as specified within the order and will not be able to be modified or combined.",
